"A pair's operation at a region and two types, FX-26's `(proj (proj cons
 @p) t1 t2)`, a pair whose tail is any type: KFX's `cons` and `car` are
 lists' (C200)."
(define-effect kfx (maxeff (read @globals) (alloc @p) (read @p) spin))
(define main (subr kfx () i64)
  (lambda ()
    (let ((x ((proj (proj cons @p) int string) 1 "a")))
      (int->i64 ((proj (proj car @p) int string) x)))))
